      "message": "Unfortunately, we\u0027re likely to need a HAL version check here, because we can\u0027t insist that devices that passed the VTS test as of Android S get their KeyMint code updated.\n\nSo could we:\n\n- move this check to a test of its own\n- include an initial check/skip like:\n```\n    if (AidlVersion() \u003c 2) {\n       GTEST_SKIP()  \u003c\u003c \"Requiring EC_CURVE only strict since KeyMint v2\";\n    }\n```    \n- add a comment, something like \"The KeyMint V1 spec required that EC_CURVE be specified for EC keys. However, this was not checked at the time so we can only be strict about checking this for implementations of KeyMint version 2 and above.\" (cf. aosp/2033925)",
